# Extra places to link agents/AGENTS.md, one path per line.
#
# The Claude Code and Codex paths are built into install.sh; this file is for
# any other tool that reads a standing instructions file. Add a path here, or
# type it when the installer asks, or pass it as an argument:
#
#   ./agents/install.sh ~/.cursor/AGENTS.md
#
# A leading ~ means the home directory, so the same list works on any machine.
